<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia manufacturing prices up 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia manufacturing prices up 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian manufacturing output prices rose 0.1 percent in the month of July and were 0.2 percent lower than in July 1995.</p>
</text>
